Package: diy.sem.plot
Type: Package
Title: Manually Plot Path Diagrams for Structural Equation Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Sebastian", "Nagy",
      email = "snagy8610@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Manually plot fully customisable path diagrams for structural equation
             models fitted with 'lavaan', rendered using 'ggplot2'. Node positions are
             set using simple x/y coordinates. Paths between nodes are drawn
             automatically, with estimates centered on the midpoint, therefore you are only required to
             specify which side of each relevant node a path should originate
             from and terminate at. A range of further fine-tuning options are
             included, facilitating creation of a path diagram exactly as you
             envision it, entirely within R.
